    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the world where only the bravest and most dexterous can survive! &quot;Walking Steel&quot; features exciting battles, strategic battles and powerful enemies. Control powerful tanks, upgrade them and fight for your survival in constant danger.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n         - Epic Tank Battles: Take part in dynamic battles where every decision can be decisive.<br />\r\n         - Improve your equipment: Collect points for destroyed tanks and upgrade your tank to become invincible on the battlefield.<br />\r\n         - World of Survival: Explore dangerous areas, find shelters and fight enemies to stay alive. <br />\r\nAre you ready to take on the challenge and prove that you are the best tanker? Join &quot;Tank Survival&quot; and immerse yourself in a new and dangerous world!",
